## Business Errors ->&dup{}

We will use a step reference that does not exist: &ghost_step{}

And an undeclared ingredient variable: @&ghost_var{10g}

Relative quantity pointing to nothing: @sugar{50% @flour}

Circular relative quantity: @salt{10% @salt}

Timer missing unit: ~timer{10}

Temperature missing unit: !{180}

## Scope Conflict ->&dup{}

This section re-declares the same output variable 'dup', which should trigger a SCOPE_CONFLICT.
